OL,3,GNEWSA'I only found out this morning':
OL,4,AFreed prisoners speak to BBC as new
OL,5,Aearly release scheme begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FA probation officer, who will be
OL,8,Fresponsible for monitoring some of the
OL,9,Fearly releases, says managing the
OL,10,Finflux of offenders is "just too much"
OL,12,FPolicing leaders are also expecting the
OL,13,Fscheme to create additional demands in
OL,14,Fterms of licence breaches, recalls and
OL,15,Ffurther offending
